From: AuraLite-Emulator Dev <dev@auralite-emu.local>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 18:47:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] U4 update

UHCI root host controller (legacy companion): PCI 0:1.2 8086:0x7020,
I/O BAR4 0xC040 register file (USBSTS.HCHALTED = bit 5 guest map),
frame list + QH/TD walker on USBCMD.RUN (doorbell + cadence sampler),
TD completion ctrl[10:0] = bytes-1 actual-length contract + IOC->USBINT,
control + bulk over the shared device model (per-controller BOT state;
setup_request takes bot_state_t*). Fix: the disk-data path now advances
the media offset by st->moved (64-byte UHCI chunks re-read LBA 0 without
it) -- regression vector ok uhci td walk (byte-for-byte sector + CSW
residue 0). 25 usb vectors (ok uhci regs / ok uhci td walk / ok uhci
halted runs no frames); negative control: reverting the RUN-gating
reddens tests/test_usb.c:556 (abort 134). Guest parity run x2
byte-identical (sha256 6f061aaebc26cc5e...): [uhci] controller at PCI
0:1.2 + I/O base = 0xc040, stick enumerated UHCI full-speed, MSC binds
the UHCI instance, test_usbfs.sh-parity receipts over 64-byte bulk.
